<title>SPAIN: Spain Fenosa unit doubled turnover in 1996.</title>
<headline>Spain Fenosa unit doubled turnover in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish utility Union Fenosa said on Monday its Union Fenosa Ingeneria unit had almost doubled turnover to 4.45 billion pesetas in 1996.</p>
<p>The unit had pretax profit of around 218 million pesetas, without providing a 1995 comparison.</p>
<p>In February Union Fenosa parent said it ended 1996 with pretax profit of 23.57 billion pesetas, up 13.7 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
